      <li>You must manually enter your subscription information in the <code>console.redhat.com</code> web console without the benefit of automatic usage reporting.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>In restricted networks, Telemetry and Red Hat Lightspeed data still gets gathered through the appropriate configuration of your proxy.</p>
