      <h2 id="insights-operator-register-disconnected-cluster_remote-health-reporting" class="group scroll-mt-20">Registering your disconnected cluster<a href="#insights-operator-register-disconnected-cluster_remote-health-reporting" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
